--- !u!1001 &1792520482
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 653289856}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 3169022222729764810, guid: 48422f878e71cc442931759086a044e1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "<size=120%>Time to generate the 3D models!</size=120%>\n\nIn this scene,
        the system will automatically generate a 3D model for each of the reference
        images created earlier.\n\nYou just need to:\n\n<color=yellow><b>1. Click
        \u201CStart 3D Generation\u201D</b></color>\nThe system will begin processing
        all images into 3D previews.\nYou will see the models appear one by one in
        the scene as they are generated.\n\n<color=yellow><b>2. Wait Until All Models
        Are Ready</b></color>\nOnce all previews have appeared and the generation
        is complete, you can continue.\n\n<color=yellow><b>3. Click \u201CCompose
        Scene\u201D</b></color>\nPress the <b>Compose Scene</b> button to move on
        to the next phase.\n\n\n\n                                                              
        <b>PRESS X TO CLOSE</b>"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
